2. 类键过滤驱动槽位（挂载可行性）
======================================================================

--- Keyboard 类键 {4d36e96b}
    KEY: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Class\{4d36e96b-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}
    Class                    = Keyboard
    ClassDesc                = @%SystemRoot%\System32\SysClass.Dll,-3002
    IconPath                 = %SystemRoot%\System32\setupapi.dll,-3
    LastDeleteDate           = hex:52 A7 03 CE 49 44 DD 01
    NoInstallClass           = 1
    UpperFilters             = kbdclass

--- HIDClass 类键 {745a17a0}
    KEY: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Class\{745a17a0-74d3-11d0-b6fe-00a0c90f57da}
    Class                    = HIDClass
    ClassDesc                = @%SystemRoot%\System32\hid.dll,-101
    IconPath                 = %SystemRoot%\system32\setupapi.dll,-24
    LastDeleteDate           = hex:14 5D 0C CE 49 44 DD 01
    NoInstallClass           = 1

--- Keyboard 类键 Properties（含 ConnectMultiplePorts）
    KEY: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Class\{4d36e96b-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\Properties
    [不可读] [WinError 5] 拒绝访问。

--- Keyboard Layout 全局
    KEY: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Keyboard Layout

### 2.1 全系统搜索 ConnectMultiplePorts / KeyboardDataQueueSize
  [ConnectMultiplePorts] 命中 0 处
  [KeyboardDataQueueSize] 命中 0 处

