3. 相关服务键
======================================================================

--- 服务 kbdhid
    KEY: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\kbdhid
    DisplayName              = @keyboard.inf,%KBDHID.SvcDesc%;Keyboard HID Driver
    ErrorControl             = 0
    Group                    = 
    ImagePath                = \SystemRoot\System32\drivers\kbdhid.sys
    Owners                   = keyboard.inf | hidirkbd.inf
    Start                    = 3
    Type                     = 1

--- 服务 kbdclass
    KEY: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\kbdclass
    DisplayName              = @keyboard.inf,%kbdclass.SvcDesc%;Keyboard Class Driver
    ErrorControl             = 1
    Group                    = 
    ImagePath                = \SystemRoot\System32\drivers\kbdclass.sys
    Owners                   = whyperkbd.inf | termkbd.inf | keyboard.inf | hidirkbd.inf
    Start                    = 3
    Type                     = 1

--- 服务 hidclass
    KEY: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\hidclass
    [不可读] [WinError 2] 系统找不到指定的文件。

--- 服务 hidbth
    KEY: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\hidbth
    DisplayName              = @hidbth.inf,%HIDBTH.SvcDesc%;Microsoft Bluetooth HID Miniport
    ErrorControl             = 0
    Group                    = extended base
    ImagePath                = \SystemRoot\System32\drivers\hidbth.sys
    Owners                   = xinputhid.inf | hidbth.inf
    Start                    = 3
    Tag                      = 2
    Type                     = 1

--- 服务 hidusb
    KEY: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\hidusb
